10
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.120
¡Está delicioso!

11
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:22.960
jayden,

12
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:24.640
¿tú

13
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.360
como yo?

14
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.040
Sí.

15
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.040
Entonces,

16
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.680
¿te gusta mi cuerpo?

17
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.960
o quien soy yo?

18
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.080
